7052..7121 Comment "/// Univalence: `idtoequiv` is an equivalence, the quasi-inverse made"
7122..7197 Comment "/// bi-invertible as `isoToEquiv` makes it, its map back both inverses. The"
7198..7275 Comment "/// record is written out: a split of `univalenceIso`\'s result reads its type"
7276..7291 Comment "/// as unknown."
